WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
Read these two sentences.

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.470
"I will watch the match tonight.

3
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.690
" "I left my watch at home.

4
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.610
" Same word.

5
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:08.650
Same spelling.

6
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.110
Same sound.

7
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.730
So is watch a noun or a verb?

8
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.550
And how can you tell, when
the word itself never changes?

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.550
Here is a clue: every word
in a sentence has a job.

10
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.690
In this mission, you'll meet
the eight main word classes.

11
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:26.650
You'll learn two quick
tests for nouns and verbs.

12
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.470
And you'll see how
clauses build simple,

13
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.070
compound and complex sentences.

14
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.930
Your mission: work out what
job each word is doing.
